 * on Small Business Saturday\, November 28\, from 11am to 5pm! Jewelry\, w
 reaths and greenery\, candles\, chocolates\, home décor\, pottery\, lip b
 alms\, bath salts\, coffee\, crafty creations\, and more! Nibble on bites 
