BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kamayan and Kwentuhan\, A Dinner Gathering
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T193000
UID:261123c1SsiNhrkEyawv4CoX0F5g
DESCRIPTION:Kapwa Collective invites the community to a shared meal! All a
 re welcome! Our time will be guided by two Filipino mental health practiti
 oners. At the end of the gathering\, we will share various community resou
 rces.\n\nThis event is free\, where food is provided by Kapwa Collective a
 nd Fellowship United Methodist Church! Kapwa Collective is an emerging fai
 th space within the United Methodist Church that is bringing together Fili
 pinos across generations to explore the intersection of justice\, creativi
 ty\, and faith. \n\nKamayan is the Filipino tradition of eating with your
  hands\, sharing a feast spread across banana leaves. Kwentuhan is the act
  of sharing stories\, while also finding ourselves in the stories of other
 s. At this gathering we will engage in the following:\n\nGetting to know o
 ur community: This is a time for us to connect\, get to know one another\,
  and share what is on our hearts\, including our griefs and pains as well 
 as our joys and celebrations.\n\nGuided storytelling: During our shared me
 al\, two facilitators will guide our conversations with reflective prompts
  and questions that invite us to share our stories.\n\nResource exchange: 
 At the end of the night\, we’ll share community resources\, such as food
  assistance and mental health services.
LOCATION:Wayside United Methodist Church
URL:https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdkiUcmEsjTwTK5CoM2KBMwTYLWTn
 VB6tB0OFU5QEpkWlpQNw/viewform
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Weekend Santa Sightings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T150000
UID:261122Q2Te8bObX0G3_OhxqwSfQg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holidays and join us at the Village for photos w
 ith Santa happening on weekends from Saturday\, November 28th to Sunday\, 
 December 20th\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily.\n\nAppointments are highly recomm
 ended\, as we cannot guarantee that we can accommodate all walk-ups throug
 hout the event series. Reserve your 5-minute window now for a $35 fee duri
 ng our initial release \\(through Friday\, November 13\\). Beginning Satur
 day\, November 14\, the fee increases to $45. Each family will receive a p
 rint to take home that day\, as well as a digital copy of their photo foll
 owing the appointment. Please note that we do not call or text waitlisted 
 guests.\\*\n\nMake the most of your Santa visit:\n\nYour photo package inc
 ludes up to five digital photos\, emailed the Monday following your appoin
 tment\, plus a print to take home that day.\n\nEnjoy writing letters to Sa
 nta and dropping them off at the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail ma
 ilbox\, plus crafts at our holiday craft tables.\n\nSweeten your visit! St
 op by Salt & Straw before or after your appointment and enjoy a compliment
 ary kids’ scoop with any ice cream purchase during Weekend Santa Sightin
 gs \\(valid each Saturday and Sunday from 11/28/26 to 12/20/26 between 11 
 a.m. to 3 p.m.\\).\n\nKeep an eye out for ME SPA’s elves\, spreading hol
 iday cheer and a little stress relief with special cards to redeem at the 
 spa. Bring yours in for a Chill Bag\, a holiday survival kit filled with g
 oodies and coupons to help you keep your cool all season long. For an extr
 a moment of relaxation\, enjoy a complimentary chair massage as scheduling
  allows.\n\nRetro Foto will be assisting in making this memory last a life
 time by providing Santa with a vintage ride for all to enjoy! Retro Foto i
 s Sonoma County’s boutique photo booth experience. Lola is a fully resto
 red 1970 Volkswagen bus that loves the camera – whether it’s as a phot
 o booth or a photo backdrop! Lola is all about making memories\, which is 
 why Santa thought this would be the perfect way to drive into the Holiday 
 season!\n\nBy attending this event\, guests consent to appear in photo/vid
 eo recordings that may be used for website photography or other purposes.\
 n\n\\*A portion of proceeds will benefit Sonoma County Secret Santa Progra
 m.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T173000
UID:261121z7FAucrVDkaolrSPnAMs0Q
DESCRIPTION:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly origin
 al\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and at
 hletically stunning skill.\n\nSonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 – This
  2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Bril
 le’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the intimate an
 d charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the Winter moon
  and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the sky\, she m
 ust find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she encounters
  mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child pleasing 
 origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and
  clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere with celest
 ial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages.\n\n
 Spectators for all showings are invited to the European style circus tent 
 to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Cornerstone Son
 oma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \n\nThe eve
 nt will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half hour show
 .\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Cornerstone Sono
 ma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase online at
  thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40. Front row
  \\(VIP\\)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details at then
 ewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly anticipated 
 event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
