 /o/12736133200 Get ready to rock out at this special Sunday Sessions! Wann
 a see your future? Come rock out for a special Sunday Sessions with Crysta
 l Ballers at Griffo! Get ready to hear these SoCo rock and rollers for a S
 unday afternoon full of your favorite hits\, delicious food from our pals 
 at Tommy's Salsa\, and of course the fantastic fall cocktail lineup from t
 he Griffo Team! See you Sundays! Who's Playing: Crystal Ballers Who's Cook
 ing: Tommy's Salsa When: Sunday\, November 29th - Doors @ 1pm Where: Griff
 o Distillery Please RSVP for this FREE\, All Ages Event. Space is Limited.
