  and 2000s back to the stage — loud\, live\, and built for a crowd. From
  Rage Against the Machine\, Radiohead and Stone Temple Pilots to Weezer\, 
 Third Eye Blind\, Incubus\, Cake\, Green Day and more\, we play the songs 
 that defined an era. Made up of longtime Bay Area musicians with roots goi
 ng back to the ’90s\, Crystal Ballers brings years of live experience to
  clubs\, festivals and private events throughout Northern California.
