DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T000000
UID:261116PN3yYLurCE6JwjV3hpbHdg
DESCRIPTION:Escape to Merry Meritage and experience a magically festive wo
 rld at The Meritage Resort and Spa. Enjoy Napa’s largest outdoor ice rin
 k\, festive events\, and holiday fun for everyone this season.
