DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Food For Thought’s 25th annual fundraiser\, Di
 ning Out For Life on Thursday\, December 3! \n\nDining Out For Life is So
 noma County's largest dine and donate event\, with over 60 participating l
 ocations—ranging from cozy coffee shops to beloved casual and fine dinin
 g spots. Each location is donating a percentage of sales to provide health
 y food and loving support to thousands of our neighbors in need.\n\nPlus\,
  patrons and donors have a chance to win one of 9 drawing prizes\, includi
 ng a 7-night stay in Mexico and packages from Oliver’s Market\, Glen Ell
 en Star\, Rotten Robbie\, River Electric\, The Junction Beer Garden\, and 
 other local restaurants. \n\nDine Out and Take Out on December 3 to Give 
 Back. Find your flavor at FFTfoodbank.org/DOFL.
