UID:261125Zxp62SAprkewioJ-QoyF_g
DESCRIPTION:The 12 Jays of Xmas VIP Donor Celebration is a special holiday
  gathering honoring the supporters and community behind Emerald Triangle C
 raft's 12 Jays of Xmas project. Celebrate 12 independent legacy cannabis f
 arms from California's Emerald Triangle\, connect with fellow supporters\,
  and help support the Humboldt County Growers Alliance \\(HCGA\\).\n\nVIP 
 donor registration is available through the Emerald Triangle Craft website
 \, with contribution levels of $125\, $250\, and $550. Join us for a celeb
 ration of community\, holiday cheer\, and independent farming heritage!
