SUMMARY:"Fresh Work" featuring Mylette Welch and Bruce K Hopkins
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T160000
UID:261023u814Yy15YUeLAkQv72I9EA
DESCRIPTION:"Fresh Work" featuring artworks by Mylette Welch and Bruce K H
 opkins\, with guest artists Nancy Dempster\, Hilary Mosberg\, Erin O'Brien
