BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Mad Hatter Holiday Festival and Parade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T193000
UID:261124zBTQAHpQlUWritZ3C48Y1w
DESCRIPTION:The Mad Hatter Holiday Festival\, Parade & Tree Lighting is he
 ld on Saturday\, December 5\, 2026. Wonderland Festival activities & the Q
 ueen's Court starts @ 2:00 PM. The Mad Hatter Holiday Parade starts @ 4:30
  PM. Tree Lighting Program starts @ 6:00 PM. Lighted Yacht Club Boat Parad
 e starts at 6:30 PM.\n\nOne of Wonderland's main attractions for the Tree 
 Lighting is the Victorian Air Ship that will host the lighting of the 50 f
 oot holiday tree with Vallejo's Mayor and the holiday's Grand Marshal\, C 
 J Anderson\, football coach at Benicia High School and former running back
  in NFL's Denver Broncos'winning Super Bowl title in Super Bowl 50 along w
 ith the Hatter's holiday songstress Tia Carroll\, blues\, soul and R&B sin
 ger\, premier vocalist of San Francisco's music circuit.\n\nThe Community 
 Grand Marshal is the established & esteemed Vallejo Symphony Orchestra bri
 nging holiday performances and classical music to the masses for decades. 
 The Mad Hatter Holiday Festival & Parade will feature Obtainium Works popu
 lar and sort after creations along with the Queen's Court's crowning of Ki
 ngs\, Queens & Princesses. Attendees will be entertained with a lighted in
 flatable Unicorn Park\, interactive children wonderland activities and two
  15 foot Flaming Feathers that encircle an area for some incredible photo-
 ops opportunities. The Flaming Feathers are the creation of the Flaming Lo
 tus Girls\, award winning Burning Man recipients\, they will also activate
  SOMA\, a beautiful and interactive giant sculpture\, originally displayed
  at Burning Man in 2009. There will be craft and food vendors\, continual 
 live performances\, interactive Tea Party activities as well as roaming R2
 D2 robots and the 501st Legion's Imperial regiment of Darth Vader and his 
 Storm Troopers\, along with all of the Mad Hatter's Tea Party guests. All 
 contributing to the whimsical and nonsensical atmosphere of the Mad Hatter
  Holiday Festival.
LOCATION:Downtown Vallejo
URL:https://www.hattervallejo.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
