  shores\, glowing riverfront evenings\, and the distinctive personalities 
 of its farm animals.\n\nHis paintings invite viewers to pause and apprecia
 te the character of a sheep\, the shimmer of waterfront lights\,\n\nor the
  stillness of a sheltered cove.
