BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Macramé Plant Hanger Workshop at Cabuya Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T160000
UID:261123loYdPd76F064mEtbzGUHyQ
DESCRIPTION:We’ll open with a ceremonial cacao or tea offering\, then ta
 ke a few minutes to set an intention\, connect to the breath\, and gently 
 stretch before creating your very own boho-style macramé plant hanger.\n\
 nWith an open heart and relaxed hands\, we’ll dive into the art of macra
 mé. You’ll get step-by-step guidance on the foundational knots. As your
  hands find the rhythm\, the knotting becomes its own physical meditation 
 while we chat\, laugh\, and craft together.\n\nWho it’s for: Absolutely 
 everyone! No yoga or macramé experience needed. This workshop is fully be
 ginner-friendly and designed with accessibility in mind.\n\nInvestment: $6
 5\, which includes ceremonial cacao and all materials: a gold ring and pre
 cut cotton cord. Pots are available for purchase\, so you can leave with y
 our hanger ready to plant.\n\nWhat to bring: An open mind and a favorite m
 ug for your cacao.\n\nMakes a great gift for the holidays! Spaces are limi
 ted to keep our circle intimate\, so reserve your spot today.
LOCATION:Cabuya Yoga + Fitness
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/macrame-plant-hanger-workshop-at
 -cabuya-yoga/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
