BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holiday Cheeseboard Workshop at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T130000
UID:2611228kVSLPZujUGp9Nr8OaAsIw
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your holiday entertaining and learn the ultimate skill
 s to wow your guests this festive season!\n\nJoin Gold Ridge Organic Farms
 ' resident cheese expert\, Alli Keyser-Marti\, for an intimate\, hands-on 
 cheeseboard workshop designed to help you create show-stopping displays fo
 r your holiday gatherings. Explore how to create your own beautiful board\
 , showcasing a wide array of flavors\, textures\, and colors. Learn how to
  incorporate a variety of edible flowers and fresh herbs\, local honey\, a
 pple cider syrup\, balsamic vinegar\, EVOO\, olives\, artisan bread\, crac
 kers\, and dips to accompany the best local cheeses made by artisan produc
 ers from Sonoma County and beyond.\n\nAll ingredients and materials includ
 ed in ticket price. You'll get to take home your creation to share with fr
 iends and family.\n\nBuilding on a culinary career starting in her teenage
  years\, in 2014 Alli Keyser-Marti fell in love with exploring the world o
 f milk\, salt\, enzymes\, and microbes. Her cheese journey includes managi
 ng Cowgirl Creamery’s original Pt Reyes shop\, overseeing the Oliver’s
  Market Stony Point cheese department\, as well as being awarded an ACEF S
 cholarship to attend the American Cheese Society's Portland conference in 
 2022\, where she successfully completed the Certified Cheese Professional
 ® exam. In 2025\, Alli also became an ACS Certified Cheese Sensory Evalua
 tor® and judged cheese for the Good Food Awards. She has followed this pa
 ssion from her backyard in California to small farms all over France\, rur
 al Ohio\, roadside stands in Sardinia\, and ferries in Croatia. Most recen
 tly you’ll find her skillfully pairing cheese with olive oil and apple t
 astings at Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, as well as overseeing our custom oli
 ve milling operations and maintaining our organic certifications.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/628788/holi
 day-cheeseboard-workshop-with-alli-keyser-marti-ccp-ccse
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T173000
UID:261121O2kYK2XpBEi4SqosEgNUCg
DESCRIPTION:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly origin
 al\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and at
 hletically stunning skill.\n\nSonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 – This
  2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Bril
 le’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the intimate an
 d charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the Winter moon
  and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the sky\, she m
 ust find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she encounters
  mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child pleasing 
 origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and
  clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere with celest
 ial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages.\n\n
 Spectators for all showings are invited to the European style circus tent 
 to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Cornerstone Son
 oma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \n\nThe eve
 nt will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half hour show
 .\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Cornerstone Sono
 ma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase online at
  thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40. Front row
  \\(VIP\\)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details at then
 ewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly anticipated 
 event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
