  Crafts\, ornaments\, wreaths\, greenery\, homemade goods galore! This yea
 r’s Christmas Bazaar will be held on December 5th\, from 10am-1:30pm. Re
 member to come to our new venue at the Alexander Valley Hall\, located at 
 5512 Hwy-128\, just outside of Healdsburg.\n\nShop the hand-made crafts\, 
 wreaths\, and goodies! Tickets are available at the door for our amazing r
 affle baskets. Bring your own bags for check out at this traditional annua
 l fundraiser\, benefiting our scholarships and local charities.  Refreshm
 ents provided to all shoppers!
