DESCRIPTION:The Bank of America Museums on Us program offers FREE weekend 
 general admission to\n\nBank of America\, Merrill and Bank of America Priv
 ate Bank credit and debit cardholders at the Napa Valley Museum of Art and
  Culture. All you need is your Bank of America\, Merrill\, or Bank of Amer
 ica Private Bank card and picture ID for access.\n\nBank of America believ
 es the arts have a unique ability to connect people and communities and he
 lp local economies thrive. Through Museums on Us\, Bank of America provide
 s its cardholders with free access during the first full weekend of every 
 month to artistic and cultural experiences in California at celebrated ins
 titutions ranging from art\, children’s and history museums to aquariums
 \, botanical gardens\, and science centers.
