DESCRIPTION:"Tending the Spark" is a heartfelt evening of inspirational si
 nging presented by Joyful Noise! Gospel Singers featuring the powerful voi
 ces and musicianship of consummate performers Melanie DeMore\, BenjaSoul \
 \(Benja Mertz\\)\, and Francisco Herrera. Audience participation is encour
 aged\, and Harmonia Community Choir \\(Sebastopol Center for the Arts’ r
 esident choir\\) led by John Maas will also sing.\n\nFood scarcity is a pr
 oblem for many of our Sebastopol area neighbors. The first two benefit con
 certs raised just under $12\,000 for the Food Pantry\, giving a meaningful
  infusion of “green energy” to this vital resource.\n\nThis is the thi
 rd annual fundraiser concert for the Interchurch Food Pantry.  Suggested 
 donation of $20 \\(cash or check\\) at the door\, no one turned away. 100%
  of donations will go to support the Food Pantry. \n\nThe venue is the be
 autiful Community Church of Sebastopol\, 1000 Gravenstein Hwy N\, Sebastop
 ol. \\(Please arrive early to assure your seat\, as it has been full every
  year!\\)
LOCATION:Community Church of Sebastopol
URL:https://www.joyfulnoisegospelsingers.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
