BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Discovering Women Poets\, a Poetry Competition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T235900
UID:261124l3iL6yHAYEOQakh8SxYuGQ
DESCRIPTION:The National League of American Pen Women (NLAPW) and the Gold
 en Gate-Marin Branch are launching a poetry competition for women over 18 
 years of age who are not currently members of the NLAPW. This regional and
  national competition will be run at the Branch level in the semi-finalist
  phase. Local winners are automatically entered into the League’s Nation
 al competition.\n\nWinners at the Branch level will receive $35 and have t
 heir entry published in the Branch newsletter. They will also be invited t
 o present their poetry in person or by Zoom.\n\nBranch winners become semi
 -finalists in the National competition\, which will award $100 to three wi
 nners. National winners will have their work and a short bio published in 
 The Pen Woman\, a national magazine. All semi-finalists will be listed in 
 the magazine.\n\nUp to three poems may be submitted for one entry fee of $
 15. Each poem should be no longer than 40 lines. There are no restrictions
  on topics or poem’s structure. Entries must be received by January 25\,
  2027.\n\nDownload Entry Form at our website: https://www.goldengatemarina
 rt.org/copy-of-contact
LOCATION:https://www.goldengatemarinart.org/
URL:https://www.goldengatemarinart.org/copy-of-contact
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
