BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gain Speaking Confidence with Mare Island Toastmasters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T203000
UID:261118b7GN9nSllEe09RGMQrS6RA
DESCRIPTION:We meet in-person only on the 1st and 2nd Thursdays of the mon
 th. However\, you can catch us online every Thursday unless the meeting da
 te falls on a holiday.\n\nPlease register at https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
 \n\nWhat is Toastmasters About?\n\nUsually at our meetings\, we will have 
 a prepared speech\, and a speech evaluation. The Grammarian and Wizard of 
 Ah's will listen for turns of phrases and the use of filler words. We also
  practice impromptu speaking during the section of the meeting called Tabl
 e Topics. During Table Topics\, at a recent meeting\, we were asked what w
 e felt was the biggest communication problem or challenge. What would you 
 answer in a fast moment? Table topics will challenge you to think quickly 
 and give an answer without preparation.\n\nYou will also hear tips on publ
 ic speaking skills at our upcoming meeting. Whether you're a seasoned trav
 eler or just looking for some adventure from the comfort of your home\, th
 is event is perfect for you.\n\nToastmasters International is all about co
 mmunication excellence\, and for 100 years and counting\, Toastmasters hav
 e been expressing themselves better\, practicing\, and evaluating in a fun
  club environment\, shining all around the world.\n\nTo find out more--Msg
  us on our webpage \\(under Contact Us\\) button at\n\nhttps://mareisland.
 toastmastersclubs.org/\n\nIf you will join us in-person on the first or se
 cond Thursday of the month\, we meet this week at Kaiser Hospital Bldg. A.
  3rd floor meeting room. When you enter the hospital building\, go past th
 e piano to the elevator. Go to the 3rd floor. Exit left out of the elevato
 r and left at the hall. Go past the gym and take a left at the hall. Walk 
 down the long hall to the meeting room.
URL:https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Join Mare Island Toastmasters and Learn Speaking Tips and Tricks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T203000
UID:2611185k_yWbiIa02euRaq-HHJCQ
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to learn some tips to improve your communication s
 kills? Will you give a speech at an upcoming meeting or event? Toastmaster
 s can help. Please join us weekly online \\(except holidays\\). We only ha
 ve a hybrid meeting \\(in-person and online only the 1st and 2nd Thursdays
  of the month.\n\nJoin us for a fun filled\, fast paced meeting at 7:30pm 
 Pacific Time.\n\nToastmasters can:\n\n1. help you communicate with confide
 nce\,\n\n2. help you improve listening skills\,\n\n3. help improve your fe
 edback skills\, and\n\n4. improve your impromptu speaking skills\, and mor
 e.\n\nThe 3 main parts to the meeting are:\n\n\\*\\*Prepared Speech\n\n\\*
 \\*Impromptu Speaking\n\n\\*\\*Evaluation\n\nUsually\, we have a meeting t
 heme for each meeting. At the meeting\, we help one another grow and impro
 ve our communication and leadership skills. We are a part of Toastmasters 
 international\, which is a non-profit organization.\n\nWe meet online on z
 oom. To get the zoom link\, go to the Signup.com link below\n\nHere's how 
 Signup.com works in 3 easy steps:\n\n1\\) Click or copy this link to see o
 ur info on SignUp.com: https://signup.com/go/WiniixA\n\n2\\) Review the op
 tions listed and choose the meeting date spot\\(s\\) you like.\n\n3\\) Sig
 n up! It's Easy - you will NOT need to register an account or keep a passw
 ord on SignUp. Once you enter the information\, we will send you the info.
  Note: Singup.com does not share your email address.\n\nSee less
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1654824822957960/1654824829624626/?aco
 ntext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A[%7B%22extra_data%22%3A%22%22%2C%22m
 echanism%22%3A%22surface%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22edit_dialog%22%7D%2C%7B%2
 2extra_data%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mechanism%22%3A%22surface%22%2C%22surface%22%
