BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garrett Hardware Holiday Pop-up Tent
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T190000
UID:261103-ckuItMfn0en0D-Aa6KupQ
DESCRIPTION:Open Monday through Saturday from 7:00 AM to 7:00 PM and Sunda
 y from 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM\, our Christmas tent is your complete destinatio
 n for trimming and decorating\, featuring artificial trees\, fresh wreaths
  and garland\, ornaments\, and indoor and outdoor lights. Just steps away\
 , The Gift Horse\, our home store\, carries holiday décor\, candles\, gif
 ts\, and stocking stuffers\, allowing families to pick out the tree and co
 mplete their gift list in one trip. Guests can enjoy a daily hot cocoa bar
 \, complimentary candy canes\, and a Letters to Santa station\, along with
  weekly visits from Santa every Saturday from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM. Special
  season highlights include a Bring Your Pet Edition for Santa photos on De
 cember 13th from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM\, plus gift wrapping lessons at The G
 ift Horse on November 15th from 1:00 PM to 2:00 PM and December 9th from 1
 2:00 PM to 1:00 PM.
LOCATION:Garrett ACE Hardware
URL:https://www.garretthardware.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Drawing & Painting Atelier - Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T163000
UID:261024DiWd3m10x02-Wv-e3z8HAg
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 6 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nOctober 29 – December
  17\, 2026\n\n1:30 PM – 4:30 PM\n\nExceptions\n\nNo class November 12 & 
 26\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nDrawing & Painting\, Extended Cl
 asses\n\nExperience Level\n\nIntermediate and Advanced\n\nAges\n\n18 and o
 lder\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$325\n\nIn this studio course\, students wil
 l bring their paintings or drawings and work in a community environment wi
 th other artists. This is an opportunity to expand your work alongside oth
 er students\, learn from each other\, share ideas\, and participate in cri
 tiques guided by the instructor. Each student will receive as much instruc
 tion as they want and can work with the instructor to develop projects bas
 ed on their next level of learning. Each week there will be a critique at 
 the end of class where students can practice speaking about their own work
  and others’. This course is for students who have been painting and dra
 wing and are ready to push their work to the next level.\n\nTables and eas
 els are provided. Students bring their own art supplies.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/drawing-painting-atelier-th
 ursdays-102926/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter Wonder Lantern Walks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T183000
UID:261023LvaENB9n3kyUoRN327YzuQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beauty and quiet magic of the season during Wint
 er Wonder Lantern Walks\, a festive after-dark experience at Sonoma Botani
 cal Garden. Guided along the route by Garden staff and volunteers\, guests
  will stroll through the winter landscape carrying glowing lanterns\, disc
 overing softly shadowed pathways\, towering trees\, and the peaceful still
 ness of the Garden beneath the night sky. Rather than a traditional docent
 -led tour\, this experience is designed as a peaceful and immersive opport
 unity to enjoy the rare experience of walking through the Garden after hou
 rs and after dark. Along the way\, enjoy moments of reflection\, seasonal 
 ambiance\, and the simple joy of gathering outdoors during the holiday sea
 son.\n\nThe evening begins with hot cocoa\, spiced cider\, wine tasting an
 d cookies from 5:30–6:00 p.m.\, followed by a brief welcome and lantern 
 walk orientation before departing together for a guided walk through the G
 arden.\n\nWinter Wonder Lantern Walks are a seasonal fundraiser that will 
 support the Garden’s programs\, collections\, and conservation efforts. 
 PLEASE READ the important accessibility and experience information\, along
  with the registration and cancellation policy below before purchasing tic
 kets.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/lantern-walks/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
