 d aloud or memorized - just keep it to 7 minutes or less 2nd Fridays of th
 e month 7pm Stories teach us about life\, about ourselves & about each oth
 er. Help to create west county's newest storytelling community. 7 Minutes 
 Max is an evening of live stories\, poems\, or readings told in 7 minutes 
