DESCRIPTION:Meet new single friends\, 40s/50s\, 5 minutes at a time\, at a
  large fun restaurant! Festive holiday attire recommended. \n\n**DISCOUNT
  TICKETS at www.thepartyhotline.com:** $35/early birds. $45/advance. $55/d
 oor\, if space permits. These events usually sell out\, so we recommend pu
 rchasing an advanced ticket online.\n\nWHEN: Saturday\, December 12\, 2026
 \, 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm.\n\nWHERE: Toast\, Hamilton Marketplace\, 5800 Nave 
 Dr\, Novato\, CA 94949. Free parking!  We ask everyone to purchase at lea
 st one drink so that this fine venue invites us back.\n\nSCHEDULE:\n\n5:45
  pm – 6:00 pm Registration.\n\n6:00 pm – 6:15 pm Speed Dating Introduc
 tion\n\n6:15 pm – 8:00 pm Speed Dating\n\nYour spot will be given away i
 f you have not checked in by 6:15 PM. \n\nCO-SPONSORED by *The Society of
  Single Professionals\, Singles Bay Area*\, and dozens of singles organiza
 tions and meetups. All events benefit The Seva Foundation\, to restore sig
 ht to the blind.\n\nMORE PARTIES at www.thepartyhotline.com.\n\n·    
     Thanksgiving Speed Dating for 40s/50s\, Nov 29\, Petaluma\n\n·  
