DESCRIPTION:Après at CAST – A Winter Open House\n\nSaturday December 12
 th 2-5pm\n\nMembers receive 2 complimentary tickets\n\nGuests • $50\n\nN
 o skis required\, just good wine and great company!\n\nJoin us for a winte
 r afternoon at CAST as we bring a little après-ski charm to wine country.
 \n\nThink cozy fireside sipping\, delicious winter bites\, live music\, an
 d festive fun\, all set against the beautiful backdrop of Dry Creek Valle
 y.\n\nBundle up\, grab a glass\, and settle in for an afternoon of wine\, 
 friends\, and winter vibes. Whether you’re here to mingle\, sip\, or sim
 ply enjoy the season\, there’s no better place to après than CAST! \n\
 nClub members: be sure to log-in to get your tickets discounted. You may a
 lso RSVP to Jordan@castwines.com
