DESCRIPTION:Winter Faire for All: Saturday\, December 12\, 11am-3pm\n\nWe 
 warmly invite your whole family to join us for Summerfield Waldorf School 
 & Farm’s 43rd Annual Winter Faire! Winter Faire is open to Summerfield f
 amilies\, their guests\, and the greater community. Children’s crafting 
 is limited to the first 300 registrants\, so we encourage you to reserve y
 our spot early by following the website link.\n\nBring your family for a d
 ay of festive crafts\, holiday treats & shopping\, a Waldorf puppet show a
 nd more. Be sure to reserve your puppet show spot and purchase Winter Fair
 e currency by clicking the button below. Wander among local artisan vendor
 s offering unique\, handmade gifts\; enjoy a puppet show\, captivating sto
 rytelling\, live music\, delicious food and treats\, warm drinks\, and a c
 ozy bonfire. Children will delight in creating seasonal treasures through 
 traditional activities such as candle dipping\, candle holder making\, her
 b wreaths\, wool angels\, and wind spirals. And don’t forget the beloved
  Snowflake Shop\, where little shoppers can discover a special holiday gif
 t for someone they love!
