BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T094500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T101500
UID:260212VKf1It_Fh0O-jtiQlYHtzw
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on first
 \, second and fourth **Saturdays of the month from 9:45 - 10:15 AM at** 
 ​**Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Marin\, 240 Channing Way\, San
  Rafael CA 94903**. Contact: Sue M. 415-298-6792​. You may view all Nor
 th Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meet
 ings.html\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emotional\, and phys
 ical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and living by their spi
 ritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a diet club or cal
 orie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of eating.\n\nOA do
 es **not** endorse any specific food plan. \n\nIf food is causing problem
 s in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery is possible\
 , and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\n**Fi
 nd a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Marin
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MovingWriting: Embodied Expressive Writing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T170000
UID:2601296-srjaj4NEq2Nnh0T91N1w
DESCRIPTION:In MovingWriting workshops\, we play with movement/dance and
  words to help us connect with our deep and creative selves in the company
  of a supportive circle. Giving voice to our own stories and witnessing th
 e stories of others brings healing\, aliveness\, and connection with other
 s.\n\nNo moving or writing experience necessary!\n\nHere's what a few rece
 nt MovingWriting participants had to say about their experience:\n\n“L
 oretta's well-crafted writing prompts sparked a writer inside me that I di
 dn't know I had… I left feeling invigorated\, accomplished and proud of 
 myself for trying something new.”\n\n“I'm neither a writer nor a dance
 r\, but Loretta made it easy to put aside my inhibitions and let my emotio
 nal body lead the way… I recommend this class for anybody at all!”\n\n
 "It felt delicious to dive into my creative moving and language self with 
 others. For days after\, I felt both emptied and filled up creatively in w
 ays that I hadn’t felt in a long time."\n\n"I felt refreshed\, renewed\,
  and like I had processed some emotional blockages… The paths were opene
 d and the words just flowed."\n\nCome move and write with us! Visit www.Mo
 vingWriting.com to learn more & register for upcoming events.
LOCATION:A private studio in Sebastopol
URL:http://www.MovingWriting.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Club Member Holiday Party - 6th Annual Sweater Contest
