 very song tells a story.\n\nFrom “Smooth Operator” and “No Ordinary 
 Love” to “The Sweetest Taboo” and “Cherish the Day\,” experience
  the music you love performed with elegance\, passion\, and undeniable all
 ure.\n\nDress in your finest.\n\nRaise a glass.\n\nFeel the rhythm.\n\nLet
  the night seduce you.\n\nSADE FOR THE HOLIDAYS\n\nAn evening of sophistic
 ation\, seduction & soul.\n\nCome experience the ultimate Sade fantasy.\n\
