 fabric textile\, then turn it into a vessel shape\, stuff it\, and add a v
 ast array of wonderful fiber and decorative elements to make a super uniqu
 e and fun piece of art. No art experience is necessary\, and all levels ar
 e most welcome. This class is perfect for beginning through experienced st
 udents.\n\nPlease bring: Sewing needle and thread\, Fabric Scissors (If yo
 u have them)\n\nOptional: You’re encouraged to bring materials from your
  own stash including fabrics\, used clothing\, yarn\, string\, lace\, ribb
 on\, beads\, old jewelry parts and other decorations.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
