BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Bright Nights at Cuvaison
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T190000
UID:261119Yui4hFAcp0yiGBVJAdfRtw
DESCRIPTION:Bright Nights is a holiday tradition at Cuvaison\, and on two 
 special Sundays the whole family is invited. Family Bright Nights brings t
 he same glowing vineyard setting\, with rows of estate vines lit with twin
 kling lights\, to guests of every age. \n\nWhile grown-ups enjoy a season
 al tasting of Cuvaison wines with cheese and charcuterie\, kids have a pai
 ring all their own: milk and cookies\, plus a festive holiday activity. It
 ’s a relaxed way to share the magic of the season and one of the few eve
 nings in Napa Valley wine country made for families. \n\n·       
   For adults: A selection of Cuvaison wines with a seasonal cheese and ch
 arcuterie pairing \n\n·         For kids: A milk and cookie pair
 ing plus a holiday activity \n\n·         Ages: Family-friendly\
 ; all ages welcome \n\n·         Hours: 5–7 pm\; arrival times
  at 5:00\, 5:15 and 5:30 pm \n\n·         Book ahead: Reservatio
 ns required\; please include every guest\, including children\, in your re
 servation \n\n·         Location: Cuvaison estate\, Los Carneros
 \, Napa Valley \n\n·         Good to know: The patio is closed d
 uring Bright Nights\, so we’re unable to accommodate pets.
LOCATION:Cuvaison Estate Tasting Room
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/cuvaison/detail/625183/bright-nights-famil
 y-night
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma's 5th Annual Holiday Makers Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T200000
UID:261119L0jslUggEk6yby9jAs5xUA
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Barber Lee Spirits Distillery in downtown
  Petaluma for a festive day of shopping\, creativity\, and holiday cheer!
  Our in-person event features a wide variety of talented local artisans 
 and makers showcasing their unique crafts and creations. Discover one-of-a
 -kind gifts\, handmade jewelry\, beautiful artwork\, woodworking\, metal c
 raft\, and more! Sip our cocktails and wine while you shop\, and enjoy all
  of the decorations in our decked-out distillery!\n\nFREE Tickets are requ
 ired \\(and will have a time reservation\, so we can space out the crowd.\
 \)\n\nChildren do not need tickets.\n\nFor the first time\, we are having 
 the Makers Fair at our own distillery and are making this event more intim
 ate with less attendees and a smaller selection of curated vendors. We wil
 l have full service of all of our cocktails\, wine\, beer\, food\, etc in 
 the front of the house\, with the vendors available for shopping on our pr
 oduction floor.\n\nTable seating will be available on a first come- first 
 serve basis.\n\nExplore the charming booths\, chat with the makers\, and f
 ind that perfect present for your loved ones. Whether you're looking for s
 omething whimsical\, stylish\, or practical\, you'll find it here. Support
  local businesses and enjoy the warm\, welcoming atmosphere. Get your fre
 e tickets soon!
LOCATION:Barber Lee Spirits
URL:http://holidayfoodfair.com/makersfair
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
