DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
UID:261118yspduXoq3kCkvD_mzsaF5Q
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards will celebrate the holiday season with its
  annual Holiday Market on December 12–13\, 2026\, transforming the estat
 e into a festive gathering featuring local artisans\, handcrafted gifts\, 
 seasonal treats and family-friendly activities. Guests can browse goods fr
 om local makers\, enjoy Bricoleur wines available for purchase and take pa
 rt in a holiday toy drive benefiting the Santa Tim Organization\, which su
 pports local families in need. Admission is $10 per adult\, with all proce
 eds donated to the organization\, and children and guests under 21 are wel
 come free of charge. Toy donations will also be accepted on-site.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
