DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
UID:261023wrJr2NPDPUmlZ1G8jAZbIA
DESCRIPTION:You’ll learn many techniques for weaving\, knotting\, wrappi
 ng\, tying\, sewing\, coiling and twisting of fiber materials to build our
  dynamic and stunning pieces to hang on the wall.\n\nThe surprising and ve
 rsatile foundation for the weaving is plastic fencing\, which opens the cr
 eative journey into much more than ordinary weaving.\n\nYou'll have access
  to plastic fencing\, many gorgeous fabrics and yarns\, beads\, buttons an
 d other decorations to add to your piece.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/ultra-textural-weaving-on-a-u
 nique-substrate-with-vicki-assegued-october-25th-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
