DESCRIPTION:Have a nagging tech question? Need help borrowing an eBook? Wh
 at about setting up an email account? Book a 30-minute\, one-on-one tech h
 elp session with Northwest Reference staff. Please note that we are not IT
  experts. We are unable to help with complex or advanced technical problem
 s\, but we will do our best to assist you or else refer you to other resou
 rces.
