BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The LIME Foundation's LIME Day - Annual Food Drive
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T140000
UID:261027cq-AzpUrGkyFRQIcPwuJgA
DESCRIPTION:Make an impact this holiday! Join LIME Day\, our annual food d
 rive giving back to the community.\n\nDate & Time: December 19th\, 8:00 A
 M – 2:00 PM Location: 1400 Petaluma Hill Rd\, Santa Rosa\n\nLIME Day is
  the LIME Foundation’s annual food drive\, giving back to the community 
 by supporting our NextGen graduates and their families. Over 92% of our gr
 aduates come from low-income families\, and this holiday season\, we’re 
 surprising families across Sonoma\, Marin\, Napa\, Mendocino\, and Lake co
 unties with boxes of food and holiday cheer.\n\nSchedule:\n\n8:00 – 10:0
 0 AM: Prepare food boxes\n\n10:00 AM – 12:00 PM: Deliver food boxes\n\n1
 2:00 – 2:00 PM: Holiday BBQ celebration\n\nWe’re looking for volunteer
 s to help prepare and deliver food boxes. To volunteer your time and give 
 back\, please reach out to support@thelimefoundation.org\n\nWe also welcom
 e donations of:\n\nNonperishable items such as canned food\, rice\, bean
 s\, and more\n\nFresh fruits and vegetables \\(accepted on LIME Day\\)\n\n
 Grocery gift cards – these help us purchase extra food and include some 
 in the boxes\n\nDrop-off locations will be posted soon.\n\nJoin us in maki
 ng this holiday season special for NextGen graduates and their families! F
 or questions\, email support@thelimefoundation.org or call 707-532-LIME
  \\(5463\\).
LOCATION:LIME Foundation Headquarters
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-lime-foundation-s-l
 ime-day-annual-food-drive/20279600/2026-12-19T08
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
