DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come t
 ogether.\n\n Join us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tas
 ting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acro
 ss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll a
 nd Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sou
 nds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n Bruce Halbohm\n\nBruce Halbohm
  is a talented keyboardist\, composer\, and multi-instrumentalist known f
 or his rich\, soulful playing and creative versatility. With a style that 
 blends jazz\, blues\, rock\, and beyond\, Bruce brings passion\, depth\, a
 nd dynamic energy to every performance and collaboration.\n\nDetails\n\nNo
  cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, s
 o we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
