BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Horizons Band Holiday Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T140000
UID:261120AUGIS9Wot0micjVVpCDWOg
DESCRIPTION:The New Horizons Band of Sonoma County was formed in 1999 with
  12 musicians. Today\, there are 80 members\, all over the age of 50! This
  holiday concert will include themes from Charlie Brown\, a Sinatra medley
 \, the gorgeous Gabriel’s Oboe\, Leonard Bernstein’s Simple Song\, two
  holiday marches\, C’est Noel\, Midnight Sleighride\, the African carol 
 Baba Yetu\, and more! There will also be an audience sing-along of traditi
 onal holiday tunes.\n\nIf you are interested in joining the band\, visit t
 heir website www.nhbsc.org or contact musical director\, Michael Milbrath 
 at mikemilbrath0@gmail.com.\n\n**Sunday\, Dec. 20th. 2 PM.** Doors open at
  1 PM. \n\n**Free Admission.**
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/new-horizons-band-holiday-concert/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
