BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Nutcracker Ballet by Dance Evolution Studios
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T130000
UID:2611181HsjcqXiME6jTlG50ELnKQ
DESCRIPTION:A professional-level presentation of Tchaikovsky’s classic N
 utcracker ballet with a spectacular community twist! Experience the timele
 ss magic of the holidays with Dance Evolution Studios (formerly Santa Rosa
  Dance Theater)! This beloved tradition tells the enchanting story of youn
 g Clara\, whose Christmas Eve dream unfolds into a world of swirling snowf
 lakes\, dancing sweets\, and unforgettable adventure.\n\nThis year’s pro
 duction elevates the tale with world-class talent and surprising new delig
 hts\, including:\n\n\\- A professional female magician\, Ari Rose Magic\, 
 bringing captivating spellwork to life as Auntie Drosselmeyer!\n\n\\- Star
 -Studded Guest Artists: Professional guest dancers—including former perf
 ormers with Dance Theater of Harlem and San Francisco Ballet. dancing alon
 gside the talented students of DES\n\n\\- Live Guest Musicians: Jeanette I
 senberg (second violinist with the Santa Rosa Symphony) and award-winning 
 pianist Robert Young\n\n\\- Community Legends: A special guest appearance 
 by the owners of Taylor Dance (formerly Nordquist Dance)\, performing as C
 lara’s parents and bringing a custom ballroom flair to the Party Scene!\
 n\nFrom exquisite choreography and lavish costumes to Tchaikovsky’s icon
 ic score\, it’s an extraordinarily rich\, family-friendly holiday experi
 ence!\n\nElevate Your Evening with VIP Tickets: Upgrade to VIP for an excl
 usive backstage tour and an elegant wine-and-charcuterie spread at intermi
 ssion. The perfect touch to make your Nutcracker night truly magical.
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutc
 racker/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
