BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Invierno en los Museos - A History Tour in Spanish
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T130000
UID:261123yzonfBQFYE-mZMITYl_-rw
DESCRIPTION:Join a walk guided in Spanish through the park’s historic si
 tes to learn more about the history of Jack London\, Beauty Ranch\, and th
 e Mexican roots of Sonoma.\n\nVisit The House of Happy Walls Museum - deco
 rated for the Christmas season - as well as the home of Jack and Charmian 
 London.   Explore their lives\, their adventures\, and the work they car
 ried out on the ranch. The group will also discuss the region’s Mexican 
 history and the people who helped shape the community we know today.\n\nTh
 is will be a leisurely walk\, with several stops to share stories\, ask qu
 estions\, and explore some of the park’s most fascinating locations.  T
 his activity is suitable for all ages.\n\n\\*\n\nÚnase a un recorrido gui
 ado en español por los sitios históricos del parque para conocer más so
 bre la historia de Jack London\, el Beauty Ranch y las raíces mexicanas d
 e Sonoma.\n\nVisita el museo «House of Happy Walls» —decorado para la 
 temporada navideña—\, así como la residencia de Jack y Charmian London
 . Explora sus vidas\, sus aventuras y el trabajo que realizaron en el ranc
 ho. El grupo también conversará sobre la historia mexicana de la región
  y las personas que ayudaron a dar forma a la comunidad que conocemos hoy.
 \n\nSe tratará de un paseo tranquilo\, con varias paradas para compartir 
 historias\, plantear preguntas y explorar algunos de los lugares más fasc
 inantes del parque. Esta actividad es apta para todas las edades.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/inviernoenmuseos26/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T203000
UID:26112171OcpoA5uESSK1d6RZBeBg
DESCRIPTION:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly origin
 al\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and at
 hletically stunning skill.\n\nSonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 – This
  2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Bril
 le’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the intimate an
 d charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the Winter moon
  and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the sky\, she m
 ust find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she encounters
  mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child pleasing 
 origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and
  clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere with celest
 ial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages.\n\n
 Spectators for all showings are invited to the European style circus tent 
 to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Cornerstone Son
 oma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \n\nThe eve
 nt will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half hour show
 .\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Cornerstone Sono
 ma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase online at
  thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40. Front row
  \\(VIP\\)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details at then
 ewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly anticipated 
 event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
