BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Handcrafted for the Holidays: Ugly Holiday Sweater/Sweatshirt Work
 shop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T140000
UID:261031JkD7VAI1okyO2W88cpd8cA
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 12:00 pm to 2:00 pm\n\nLocation\
 n\nRoom 110\n\nCategory\n\nFiber Arts\, Handcrafted for the Holidays\, Sus
 tainability\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\nAll ages welcome.
  Children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult.\n\nAdult Registration\
 n\n$25\n\nUnder 18 Registration\n\n$15\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$15 
 – $25\n\nYou bring the sweater or sweatshirt\, we’ll bring the ugly! J
 oin us for the most fabulously tacky workshop of the season where crafting
  meets questionable fashion choices. BYOS \\(Bring your own sweater/sweats
 hirt/shirt! We will have a few on hand.\\) We’ll provide googly eyes\, p
 om-poms\, recycled materials\, stencils and enough tinsel to make your swe
 ater/sweatshirt visible from space. Our crafty SCC elves will be on hand t
 o help you turn “meh” into “magnificently hideous.” Perfect for fa
 milies\, friends\, co-workers\, or anyone who takes holiday chaos seriousl
 y. Perfect for families\, co-workers\, or anyone who takes holiday chaos s
 eriously. Hot chocolate and pumpkin spiced chai will be available.Then str
 ut your creation at Lighting of the Plaza in downtown Sonoma that same nig
 ht Saturday\, Nov 21! Maybe we meet up as a team!!BYOS \\(Bring your own S
 weater/Sweatshirt/Shirt\\) Materials & decor will be provided but feel fre
 e to bring your own.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/ugly-holiday-sweater-worksh
 op/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
