UID:261107hEYN7VM2G02MRUegMkY6Sg
DESCRIPTION:Prime Rib Christmas Eve at Songbird Parlour offers a cozy\, ca
 ndlelit holiday dining experience in Glen Ellen. Chef Brian will prepare s
 low-roasted\, herb-crusted prime rib\, carved to order and served with au 
 jus\, house-made horseradish cream\, cast-iron focaccia\, and a seasonal s
 ide. Guests can choose a 12-ounce cut for $65 or a 16-ounce cut for $80. T
 he full dinner menu will also be available. Walk-ins are welcome\, but res
 ervations are strongly encouraged for this festive Christmas Eve gathering
 .
