UID:261119vjCNAyIgtEeIVRf2h6J9yA
DESCRIPTION:Bright Nights is a holiday tradition at Cuvaison\, and on two 
 special Sundays the whole family is invited. Family Bright Nights brings t
 he same glowing vineyard setting\, with rows of estate vines lit with twin
 kling lights\, to guests of every age. \n\nWhile grown-ups enjoy a season
 al tasting of Cuvaison wines with cheese and charcuterie\, kids have a pai
 ring all their own: milk and cookies\, plus a festive holiday activity. It
 ’s a relaxed way to share the magic of the season and one of the few eve
 nings in Napa Valley wine country made for families. \n\n·       
   For adults: A selection of Cuvaison wines with a seasonal cheese and ch
 arcuterie pairing \n\n·         For kids: A milk and cookie pair
 ing plus a holiday activity \n\n·         Ages: Family-friendly\
 ; all ages welcome \n\n·         Hours: 5–7 pm\; arrival times
  at 5:00\, 5:15 and 5:30 pm \n\n·         Book ahead: Reservatio
 ns required\; please include every guest\, including children\, in your re
 servation \n\n·         Location: Cuvaison estate\, Los Carneros
 \, Napa Valley \n\n·         Good to know: The patio is closed d
 uring Bright Nights\, so we’re unable to accommodate pets.
LOCATION:Cuvaison Estate Tasting Room
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/cuvaison/detail/625183/bright-nights-famil
 y-night
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
