BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting in Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261227T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261227T170000
UID:260212Ltl2Ti28bUinBFHTZEgxTg
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits.\n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on **Sunda
 ys from 4:00 – 5:00 PM** **at Christ Church United Methodist\, 1717 Yulu
 pa Ave.\, Room #4\, Santa Rosa**. Contact: Abigail (707) 293-5888. You may
  view all North Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northb
 ayoa.org/meetings.html .\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emoti
 onal\, and physical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and livi
 ng by their spiritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a d
 iet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of e
 ating.\n\nOA does **not** endorse any specific food plan.\n\nIf food is ca
 using problems in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery
  is possible\, and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa
 .org/\n\n**Find a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Christ Church United Methodist
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261227T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261227T170000
UID:2604303lXvGb3CpE-FQKGSWcyLTA
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
